  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">앞으로 여러분이 살아갈 세상에서는<br />이미지 속에 의미와 개념을 담고 <br />표현하고 읽어 내고 소통호는 능력이 중요하고<br />이미지 컨트롤에 익숙치 않은 것은 <br />마치 문맹과 같을 수 있다는 <br />이야기로 타이포그라피를 해 보았습니다.</p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998116335A1529E713' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D391335A1529EB0E' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A0D4335A1529EE39' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B02C335A1529F00F' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D247335A1529F120' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99E318335A1529F521' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99DAF2335A1529F82C' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9942EB335A1529FA11' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F267335A1529FD20' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99C9AB335A1529FF1E' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9995B3335A152A0011' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996012335A152A0414' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993413335A152A072C' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9974D4335A152A0A01' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992AA0335A152A0C04' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/997134335A152A0F26' class=\"txc-image\" /></p><p><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99D8AA335A152A1020' class=\"txc-image\" /></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
